WEBVTT

06:34.420 --> 06:38.540
Phenyl is over. The toilet's not
been cleaned for two days now.

06:40.830 --> 06:45.130
Don't grumble about it later.
Same story everyday.

06:46.330 --> 06:48.290
Someday he'll end up
kissing himself!

08:08.130 --> 08:10.920
God! I can't do
this anymore!

08:12.250 --> 08:14.670
I'll leave early today.

08:15.380 --> 08:18.040
The crowd while
commuting is insufferable!

08:19.210 --> 08:22.580
Does he have any
idea how far off I stay?

08:26.420 --> 08:29.630
Lives all by himself.
A lonely household.

08:32.790 --> 08:36.290
Neither has a father at
home nor a husband.

08:38.210 --> 08:40.210
How will he understand?

08:42.330 --> 08:45.960
Enough is enough.
I will leave early today!

09:57.130 --> 10:01.420
She left him, one day
everyone will leave him.

10:03.500 --> 10:04.630
Bloody old bugger!

10:11.130 --> 10:13.290
If only he paid the
salary on time.

10:14.330 --> 10:18.250
Such a miser!
Won't pay a penny more!

10:19.960 --> 10:21.880
No day-offs, no money..

10:22.790 --> 10:26.080
are two days enough for
Durga Puja holidays?

10:27.960 --> 10:30.830
And I've to slog all day.

12:47.130 --> 12:51.670
I can't come tomorrow, Sir.
There's a wedding in the family.

12:58.580 --> 13:00.000
Close the door!

13:52.670 --> 13:56.130
Congratulations..

13:57.630 --> 14:01.290
and celebrations!

14:02.670 --> 14:09.080
When I tell everyone
that you're in love!

14:11.380 --> 14:15.630
Congratulations..

14:40.250 --> 14:45.670
Dear Mom,
You've done it!

14:46.630 --> 14:52.960
Love,
Samson.

15:06.790 --> 15:08.920
Good morning!
- Morning.

15:09.750 --> 15:10.790
Happy birthday!

15:12.920 --> 15:15.380
And?
What plans for today?

15:16.750 --> 15:19.540
Strolling around,
watching films, alone.

15:20.250 --> 15:22.540
Dining, alone.

15:32.210 --> 15:33.580
Weird guy!

15:34.380 --> 15:35.500
Complete crackpot.

16:49.210 --> 16:51.750
Happy birthday!
How are you?

17:15.380 --> 17:17.830
Roasted nuts, anyone?

17:18.920 --> 17:23.670
Roasted nuts for you!

17:30.040 --> 17:32.710
Roasted nuts for you!

17:34.210 --> 17:35.380
Yes, sir..

17:55.920 --> 17:58.080
Here, Sir.

18:04.250 --> 18:06.290
Roasted nuts for you!

18:14.630 --> 18:18.250
Don't know what more to
do! Everyone's the same.

18:19.130 --> 18:20.920
Every single one of them!

18:25.920 --> 18:27.170
Boyfriend?

18:28.790 --> 18:30.630
As usual.

18:32.040 --> 18:33.460
What happened?

18:58.000 --> 19:02.920
What do I say? As you know by
now I always do this to myself.

19:03.750 --> 19:07.330
Sleepless last night,
no food, I've just..

19:11.630 --> 19:14.630
No.. I don't want
that. It's alright.

19:36.790 --> 19:39.920
Love yourself, for a change.

19:41.920 --> 19:45.210
All else will fall in place.

21:43.420 --> 21:47.380
Happy birthday to me!

21:48.750 --> 21:52.670
Happy birthday to me!

21:54.290 --> 21:59.130
Happy birthday, dear
Samson!

22:01.040 --> 22:05.540
Happy birthday to..

22:07.290 --> 22:08.920
me!

24:22.170 --> 24:26.630
Rock-a-bye baby..

24:33.380 --> 24:40.420
Rock-a-bye baby,
On the tree..

26:38.460 --> 26:43.000
Mr. Gomes, don't worry,
nothing's happened.

26:43.040 --> 26:45.920
Just a little bleeding,
nothing much.

26:45.960 --> 26:51.040
Don't worry, we'll take you to
the hospital, it'll be okay.

26:51.080 --> 26:53.790
Maybe just a concussion.

26:54.750 --> 26:59.040
Doctor, how bad is the trauma?
-The trauma's pretty bad.

26:59.080 --> 27:03.500
Lot of blood loss. It's a
pretty serious concussion.

27:04.170 --> 27:07.540
Samson, just keep
your eyes open!

27:08.080 --> 27:10.210
Samson, look at me
and you'll be fine.

27:11.170 --> 27:13.000
Who is Mr. Gomes?

27:14.880 --> 27:17.580
Who is Samson?

27:21.290 --> 27:22.710
Who am I?

28:20.250 --> 28:23.830
Okay, listen..

28:24.330 --> 28:27.710
my lanes..

28:28.750 --> 28:32.130
my flyover..

28:33.500 --> 28:36.960
my park..

28:37.460 --> 28:40.130
my city..

28:40.380 --> 28:43.130
my Kolkata..

28:43.170 --> 28:45.540
I am not going anywhere..

28:45.880 --> 28:50.130
leaving them behind.

31:02.630 --> 31:05.210
Never lived away from this
city!

31:06.130 --> 31:08.750
Memories in the
shadow of flyovers!

31:09.460 --> 31:11.920
Some chits that had come
flying!

31:12.670 --> 31:15.130
This city made letters
out of them!

31:16.670 --> 31:19.330
Our days, our childhood
days!

31:19.790 --> 31:22.250
Grass peeping from the
half-fisted tramlines!

31:22.920 --> 31:25.670
Raindrops,
on the fences, in my eyes!

31:25.710 --> 31:28.670
My home, today,
Tomorrow, a faraway land!

31:30.000 --> 31:32.580
Have found friends in many a
friends!

31:33.000 --> 31:35.500
Have concealed my
habit of crying!

31:36.250 --> 31:38.630
Have walked up to the terrace
at midnight!

31:39.420 --> 31:42.710
And discovered, my city
has become a continent!

31:44.080 --> 31:46.380
The streets flow
everyday like poetry!

31:47.040 --> 31:49.750
It's houses like
books of short stories!

31:50.250 --> 31:52.580
This is where you'd
find me and you!

31:53.000 --> 31:55.500
How then do I
leave this city behind?

31:58.580 --> 32:01.080
My father used to recite
this poem, you know.

32:01.670 --> 32:05.830
This city for me, is like a
living person. In totality.

32:06.580 --> 32:10.710
Say.. the empty streets
at night?

32:11.330 --> 32:14.380
Each and every street,
that school friend..

32:14.920 --> 32:16.290
that lover from college..

32:17.080 --> 32:19.880
that curly haired
activist guy next door..

32:20.170 --> 32:23.630
who'd notice my newly blossoming
breasts on the sly.

32:31.380 --> 32:34.710
You know what, today at
that park near my house..

32:34.750 --> 32:38.170
I felt as if a tree was
comforting me.

32:38.670 --> 32:39.880
It caressed my hair.

32:40.290 --> 32:44.170
And then, when I looked into
it's eyes, it dazzled a smile.

32:45.080 --> 32:52.750
So, how do I leave this city,
that tree, behind for Bombay?

32:54.080 --> 32:59.540
And why? To fight
with you everyday?

33:24.170 --> 33:28.630
Fine, if you can't deal with this, let's
call this off.

33:28.670 --> 33:33.250
And if you agree, let me know,
won't come to the airport.

33:33.500 --> 33:34.710
Bye.

37:10.330 --> 37:13.920
The city has changed, right?
- Your eyes have. Myopia.

37:19.000 --> 37:20.960
I've come here for my girl.

37:22.040 --> 37:23.830
Forgotten your Bengali,
haven't you?

37:28.500 --> 37:30.040
So, when do we discuss?

37:32.210 --> 37:35.210
I need to join back soon.
- Tomorrow?

37:36.580 --> 37:38.880
You must be tired
right now?

37:45.830 --> 37:47.250
Whatever you say.

40:46.830 --> 40:48.080
So, this is the place?

40:49.580 --> 40:50.880
Nice.

42:09.000 --> 42:10.380
So..

42:12.170 --> 42:13.710
great!

42:14.790 --> 42:16.040
Great.

42:29.250 --> 42:30.920
Listen, we need to talk.

42:32.040 --> 42:35.420
Before it's too late.
What I want to say is..

42:37.330 --> 42:38.750
Shit!

42:43.080 --> 42:44.630
Bird shit actually.

42:47.380 --> 42:49.000
It's an Armani shirt
and you're joking?

43:16.880 --> 43:18.380
Look, what I was saying was..

43:19.580 --> 43:23.170
we'll have to move in eventually. But it
can't be Kolkata.

43:23.670 --> 43:24.670
Because..

44:13.080 --> 44:15.460
Look, what I have..

44:38.880 --> 44:40.250
Look..

44:41.290 --> 44:43.170
what I feel is..

44:44.830 --> 44:50.630
treating this as an adjustment and
not sacrifice, would be more apt.

44:51.040 --> 44:54.040
I'm not even going
into the career angle.

44:54.960 --> 44:57.250
If you look at it as a city,
it is... Oh!

45:00.420 --> 45:01.830
What is it?

45:02.460 --> 45:05.080
Come here, quick! Sit down!
- Red ants! Bloody red ants!

45:06.080 --> 45:09.500
Come here!
What happened?

45:09.540 --> 45:11.710
Let me see!
What is it?

45:13.250 --> 45:14.330
Oh my God!

45:14.750 --> 45:16.250
Let me see what I have.

45:18.170 --> 45:20.500
Okay, wait! Wait!
- Oh my God!

45:21.460 --> 45:22.540
One second!

45:23.080 --> 45:25.540
You're the limit!
Okay, now leave it.

45:26.170 --> 45:28.960
Holy cow!
- Leave it.

45:29.710 --> 45:31.790
Don't touch it! Wait.
- Over here, up here!

45:32.380 --> 45:34.420
Stop moving! Don't fuss!

45:34.880 --> 45:36.920
There.. there.. there!
- Stay still!

45:50.750 --> 45:52.130
I don't want to say anything.

45:54.920 --> 45:56.500
No arguments to offer.

46:03.380 --> 46:06.630
If you don't relocate, I'll have
to quit my job and come here.

46:13.960 --> 46:15.920
But don't tell yourself
that I've told you that.

48:19.670 --> 48:21.920
So Athletico di Kolkata
tops again.

48:22.580 --> 48:24.830
Now for the weather report.

48:25.080 --> 48:29.580
South Bengal has experienced major
thunderstorms in the last 24 hours.

48:29.960 --> 48:33.500
Districts as well as the city of
Kolkata have suffered badly.

48:33.960 --> 48:38.790
Countless trees have been
uprooted leading to traffic jams.

48:39.250 --> 48:41.380
The Met department reports..

48:41.420 --> 48:46.040
storms clocking 150 kph
which have ravaged the city.

48:46.460 --> 48:48.830
But the Alipore Met
Dept. also forecasts..

48:48.880 --> 48:51.580
an improvement in the scenario in the
next 24 hrs.

48:51.920 --> 48:54.170
We will have to leave early
in the morning.

48:54.540 --> 48:55.670
Yes.

48:55.960 --> 48:59.670
Now for a commercial break.
We'll be right back.

49:59.670 --> 50:01.750
I have a surprise for you.
- What?

50:02.500 --> 50:04.420
All this while I've had
a room-mate.

50:05.040 --> 50:08.040
What?
- Acquired from a friend in Kolkata.

50:25.880 --> 50:27.880
Wait!
- What is it?

50:41.250 --> 50:42.540
What exactly are you upto?

51:04.210 --> 51:05.290
You want me to sit?

52:29.420 --> 52:31.130
Ready?
- Ready!

52:42.500 --> 52:43.500
Bingi!

52:47.710 --> 52:50.500
Oh!
Hey Bingi!

52:51.880 --> 52:53.960
Oh Bingi! Missed you so much!

52:57.080 --> 52:58.710
What are you doing baby?

53:00.750 --> 53:03.670
Okay, Bingi!
Say hello!

53:04.170 --> 53:05.540
Say hello, come on!
- Hi!

53:05.580 --> 53:07.170
Say hello!
- Hi!

53:07.210 --> 53:09.210
Come on, Bingi, come on!
- Hi!

53:09.250 --> 53:11.540
Say hello?
Come on, Bingi!

53:14.040 --> 53:15.290
No, Bingi!
- Hi!

53:16.080 --> 53:16.920
Come on, Bingi!

53:17.540 --> 53:20.750
Bingi, No!
- Not his favourite, am I?

53:21.500 --> 53:22.170
Bingi!

53:23.540 --> 53:26.130
Her favourite. It's a she.
- She!

53:26.750 --> 53:27.880
Bingi, come on!

53:28.290 --> 53:29.540
Come on, Bingi!

53:30.250 --> 53:31.290
Come on, say hello!

53:31.790 --> 53:33.920
Say hello!
Come on, Bingi!

53:34.210 --> 53:35.420
The other woman?

53:38.460 --> 53:40.290
Come on, give me
your hand!

53:40.330 --> 53:41.920
Come on, handshake, Bingi!

53:42.750 --> 53:45.000
Come on!
Come on, give me your hand!

53:45.330 --> 53:46.170
Bingi..

53:47.080 --> 53:47.830
Bingi!

53:48.960 --> 53:50.830
What are you doing baby?
Come on!

53:51.420 --> 53:53.500
Come on Bingi! What happened,
Bingi? Come on!

53:55.040 --> 53:56.500
What is it Bingi?

53:57.330 --> 53:59.380
Come on, Bingi!
What's wrong?

54:00.670 --> 54:01.290
Bingi!

54:02.580 --> 54:03.380
Bingi?

54:05.130 --> 54:05.960
Bingi?

54:06.000 --> 54:08.290
Bingi, what are you looking at?
Bingi!

54:11.210 --> 54:13.130
Come on! Come on, Bingi,
come here! Bingi!

54:13.830 --> 54:14.750
Bingi!

54:15.290 --> 54:16.040
Bingi!

54:16.830 --> 54:18.170
Bingi, come here!

54:18.670 --> 54:19.750
I said come here, Bingi!

54:21.420 --> 54:22.630
Bingi!

54:33.880 --> 54:35.170
What's wrong with her?

58:32.170 --> 58:34.000
We'll start with the books after
this.

58:34.040 --> 58:36.040
So, this is funny no?

58:37.290 --> 58:42.170
So.. one, two, three,
four, five, six, seven.

58:43.080 --> 58:44.290
Okay.

58:45.460 --> 58:46.460
Books are done.

58:47.040 --> 58:48.670
What do you mean?
Many more to go!

58:48.710 --> 58:50.880
No, we're done.
- No, how is that?

58:50.920 --> 58:51.630
Yes!

58:53.250 --> 58:54.290
But DVDs?

58:54.830 --> 58:56.130
DVDs..

58:57.920 --> 59:01.250
Yes, we'll go.
But after this?

59:01.500 --> 59:03.170
Let me finish this please?

59:03.460 --> 59:06.500
We usually go for our daily
walk around this time.

59:07.080 --> 59:08.960
Oh! Curtains?

59:10.170 --> 59:12.170
Curtains..
- We'll do the curtains tomorrow.

59:13.420 --> 59:14.460
I'm not at home
tomorrow.

59:15.790 --> 59:18.000
Oh Bingi, we'll go my
friend, let me..

59:18.420 --> 59:20.210
let me first finish
with this..

59:20.250 --> 59:23.000
incredibly sexy woman..

59:23.630 --> 59:25.670
who has broken into my flat.

59:26.130 --> 59:27.710
Let it be. Enough now.

59:29.960 --> 59:32.790
This Bingi of yours is
very possessive, I must say.

59:33.330 --> 59:34.880
Look how upset she is.

59:34.920 --> 59:37.130
Ya.. ya..
- What do you mean 'ya'?

59:38.500 --> 59:39.630
Anyway, okay, please go.

59:40.080 --> 59:42.710
Oh God! Bingi!
I'm going!

59:45.670 --> 59:46.920
You know..

59:47.790 --> 59:49.420
actually..

59:51.000 --> 59:52.130
you're getting healthy.

59:53.500 --> 59:55.380
I'm getting what?
- Healthy?

59:55.420 --> 59:56.750
Alright!
- You should come with..

59:56.790 --> 59:59.210
- I'm getting healthy?
Already nitpicking?

59:59.250 --> 01:00:01.880
I said you should come for a
walk, that's what I said.

01:00:03.210 --> 01:00:04.710
You are getting healthy!

01:00:06.630 --> 01:00:09.330
Okay, fine!
- Fine, let's go!

01:00:10.040 --> 01:00:13.290
Okay, Bingi, stop it man!
- Come on, let's go!

01:00:14.710 --> 01:00:17.000
Actually, you know..
- This is healthy!

01:00:17.040 --> 01:00:19.000
What are you doing!
- Come, I'll show you!

01:00:19.250 --> 01:00:21.210
There's nothing to show,
you are getting healthy!

01:00:21.830 --> 01:00:22.880
Bingi!

01:00:23.420 --> 01:00:25.750
You're becoming healthy.
- I've never seen you in shape.

01:00:26.130 --> 01:00:28.830
What I'm saying..
Bingi, come?

01:00:29.710 --> 01:00:30.710
Let's go!

01:00:32.540 --> 01:00:33.630
What is it?

01:00:34.290 --> 01:00:35.080
Bingi?

01:00:38.170 --> 01:00:39.210
Come, let's go.

01:00:42.580 --> 01:00:44.210
What are you looking at?

01:00:45.040 --> 01:00:47.040
Hello Bingi..
Let's go?

01:00:48.880 --> 01:00:50.040
This is weird!

01:00:52.330 --> 01:00:53.580
Bingi, come on!

01:00:55.880 --> 01:00:57.040
Bingi!

01:00:57.290 --> 01:01:00.630
I said let's go!
Come on, Bingi, let's go!

01:01:04.330 --> 01:01:05.250
Bingi!

01:01:06.250 --> 01:01:07.420
Bingi, come here, I said!

01:01:09.380 --> 01:01:10.580
Bingi!

01:01:15.460 --> 01:01:16.750
Let's get back to the list,
shall we?

01:01:18.250 --> 01:01:19.420
Shall we?

01:01:20.250 --> 01:01:23.000
Ya..
- Come, let's go back to work.

01:01:28.460 --> 01:01:29.540
Come, sit.

01:01:36.330 --> 01:01:38.250
So, where were we?

01:01:38.290 --> 01:01:41.960
I'm doing the curtains, the
cupboards, pretty much everything.

01:01:42.000 --> 01:01:45.710
The most important one you're
doing on your own is the kitchen.

01:01:45.750 --> 01:01:47.960
Not at all!

01:01:49.040 --> 01:01:50.210
Oh God!

01:01:51.420 --> 01:01:54.080
Listen, you sit.
You stay back because..

01:01:54.420 --> 01:01:57.130
she's really cranky.
I'll go take her for the walk.

01:01:58.880 --> 01:02:00.040
I'll just come.

01:02:01.920 --> 01:02:04.130
Let's go.
Come on, Bingi.

01:02:04.710 --> 01:02:06.330
Come on, let's go!

01:05:01.080 --> 01:05:03.380
Buzz off, Bingi!
Just buzz off!

01:05:03.750 --> 01:05:05.580
Come on, Bingi!
Buzz off!

01:05:06.040 --> 01:05:07.380
Buzz off, Bingi!

01:05:07.750 --> 01:05:08.710
Just..

01:05:52.500 --> 01:05:54.250
Just buzz off, Bingi,
please buddy!

01:06:26.630 --> 01:06:28.500
Bye.
- Bye!

01:06:34.080 --> 01:06:35.790
See you!
- Bye!

01:07:23.250 --> 01:07:27.080
Bingi! Lunch?
You want to have lunch?

01:07:27.500 --> 01:07:31.460
Come, food Bingi?
Bingi, lunch?

01:07:31.500 --> 01:07:34.830
Come on, Bingi!
Eat, food!

01:07:34.880 --> 01:07:36.670
Food, Bingi!
Bingi!

01:07:37.250 --> 01:07:39.000
Eat?
Bingi!

01:07:39.330 --> 01:07:43.040
Bingi, food! Have it
Bingi, it's your lunch!

01:07:43.080 --> 01:07:46.170
Bingi, lunch!
Bingi, food?

01:07:46.830 --> 01:07:48.000
Bingi, just eat!

01:09:20.830 --> 01:09:24.330
Hell hath no fury like a
woman scorned, right?

01:10:18.250 --> 01:10:20.630
Come here you bitch!
Come here!

01:10:27.080 --> 01:10:28.420
Come here!

01:10:29.460 --> 01:10:31.290
You bloody bitch!
Come here!

01:10:35.330 --> 01:10:36.500
Come here!

01:10:37.000 --> 01:10:38.290
Come here!

01:10:40.380 --> 01:10:42.580
Where are you fleeing?
- Rahul!

01:10:42.630 --> 01:10:44.380
Come here you bitch!
Just come here!

01:10:44.960 --> 01:10:46.040
I'll skin you alive!

01:10:47.420 --> 01:10:48.750
Rahul!

01:10:52.750 --> 01:10:53.710
Rahul!

01:11:43.880 --> 01:11:44.580
It's okay!

01:11:48.670 --> 01:11:51.330
It's okay!
It's okay, honey.

01:11:58.250 --> 01:12:01.790
It's okay, honey.
It's alright.

01:12:02.250 --> 01:12:04.420
We have discussed this, right?

01:12:05.080 --> 01:12:07.630
We'll leave her with your
mom in Kolkata.

01:12:09.790 --> 01:12:11.170
Why did you do all this?

01:12:15.210 --> 01:12:17.830
Besides, did she do it
on purpose? No, right?

01:12:21.380 --> 01:12:22.630
It's okay!

01:13:37.130 --> 01:13:39.170
Bingi!
- What? Bingi!

01:13:39.210 --> 01:13:39.880
Rahul!

01:14:02.380 --> 01:14:04.670
What cremation? One is in coma.

01:14:05.000 --> 01:14:07.790
The other's dead and
has been sent to the morgue..

01:14:07.830 --> 01:14:09.130
for post morterm.

01:14:10.000 --> 01:14:12.540
Come now, get it in. Can't help if
it's a full house as well.

01:14:12.960 --> 01:14:14.330
Don't worry, there's room.

01:14:17.960 --> 01:14:19.170
Can I take a leak?

01:14:19.710 --> 01:14:21.000
Come fast,
we've to get it in.

01:15:01.130 --> 01:15:07.710
The moment I saw you,
